# VietnamGuide - Project Guidelines & Rules
# Canonical Location: M:\Projects\vietnamguide

## 1. Project Directory & Workspaces
- Canonical Local Root: M:\Projects\vietnamguide
- All source files, edits, git commits, and tool executions MUST operate within M:\Projects\vietnamguide.
- Do NOT read or write to D:\Documents\vietnamguide or C:\Users\NCTaam\projects\vietnamguide.

## 2. Architecture & Tech Stack
- Platform: WordPress 6.8+ on AlmaLinux 8 VPS
- Web Server: OpenLiteSpeed with LSCache active
- Theme: `wordpress/wp-content/themes/vietnamguide-premium` (Guide Experience Design System)
- Must-Use Plugin: `wordpress/wp-content/mu-plugins/vietnamguide-core.php` (Core security, single H1, Rank Math schema author normalization, admin-first guards)
- Editorial Standards: Evidence-led Concierge model, Single H1 contract, Schema Author = "VietnamGuide editorial team", pilot routing allowlist in `inc/guide-routing.php`.

## 3. Remote VPS Credentials & Deployment
- Host: 66.42.48.146:2209
- User: root
- Private Key: C:/Users/NCTaam/.ssh/deploy_bot_key
- Remote Web Root: /usr/local/lsws/vietnamguide.net/html
- Remote Web Owner: vietnamguidewpnet:vietnamguidewpnet
- Remote Backup Dir: /usr/local/lsws/vietnamguide.net/backup-website
- Automation Overwrite Guard: `VG_ADMIN_FIRST_ALLOW_AUTOMATION_OVERWRITE=1` required when updating post fields via WP-CLI.

## 4. Verification Suites
- Local AST & Routing: `pwsh -NoProfile -File ops/verify-guide-experience.ps1`
- Local Mutation Suite: `pwsh -NoProfile -File ops/verify-guide-experience-mutations.ps1`
- Remote Live Verifier: `wp --allow-root --path=/usr/local/lsws/vietnamguide.net/html eval-file /usr/local/lsws/vietnamguide.net/html/ops/verify-guide-experience-live.php`
- Public HTTPS Verifier: `powershell -NoProfile -File ops/verify-guide-experience-public.ps1`

## 5. Git Workflow
- Active Branch: `master`
- Remote: `origin` (`https://github.com/nctaam/vietnamguide.git`)
- Follow Conventional Commits format (`feat:`, `fix:`, `docs:`, `refactor:`, `test:`).
